  m_Name: Curator Pendelton
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Curator Pendelton
  offerText: I offer you a grand, historic chandelier. Pay my asking price, and its
    radiant light will completely erase your earthly anxieties without taking up
    floor space.
  acceptResultText: You buy it, but it is far too heavy to hang. It sits massively
    on your floor, entirely broken. You feel absolutely scammed.
  rejectResultText: You decline the dusty relic, feeling slightly uncultured but
    financially secure.
  acceptedDelayedText: The ancient chandelier was harboring toxic, century-old mold
    spores! Breathing them in gives you a severe, agonizing lung infection.
  rejectedDelayedText: Just from standing near Pendelton and his cursed antiques,
    the mold spores clung to your clothes. You wake up with a terrible, rasping cough.
